        {
          "text": "Ne khunzu yaIsiraeli, shishilabaho khandi eshisisia eshifumira kata lihwa okhubanyasia tawe, mu abo bosi ababafumbila, ababalekanga; mana balamanya mbu isie nisie OMWAMI.",
