              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kano niko aka Omwami NYASAYE aboola; mbu Olwa ndalaba nikhung'aasiye abeinza yaIsiraeli okhurula mumbia tsiabandu etsia basalaasibwamwo, nindolosia obutakatifu bwanje mubo mumoni tsiamahanga, mana balamenya mushialo shiabwe, eshia ndaheelesia omusumba wanje Yakobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo balamenyamwo shisale; toto, baloombakha tsinzu, nibaraaka emikunda chiemitsabibu, nibamenya shisale, olwa emba nikholile obukhalachi khubosi ababalekanga, ababafumbilakhwo; mana balamanya mbu isie nisie OMWAMI Nyasaye wabwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.26",
